<!-- Intro + safety -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">The trip</p>
    <h2>An unforgettable trip 30 minutes from Lima</h2>
    <p class="lead">3.5 hours aboard a comfortable, safe yacht with an experienced crew, out to a colony of thousands of sea lions where you can swim in their natural habitat.</p>
    <div class="safety-strip">
      <div class="sf"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.4-3 7.6-7 9-4-1.4-7-4.6-7-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg><span><b>No need to swim well</b><span>You enter the sea with a life vest, worn throughout the trip.</span></span></div>
      <div class="sf"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"/></svg><span><b>The sea lions don't bite</b><span>You swim with the playful, curious pups; the adults stay on the island.</span></span></div>
      <div class="sf"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M5 8h14M7 11a5 5 0 0 0 10 0"/></svg><span><b>Safe boarding</b><span>Private pier in La Punta, life vests and travel insurance for everyone.</span></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Highlights -->
<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Highlights</p>
    <h2>What you'll see</h2>
