      <article class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><span class="tag tag--ok">Guaranteed</span><h3>Sea lions</h3><p>A colony of 5,000+ at the Palomino Islands · optional swim.</p></div></article>
      <article class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><span class="tag tag--ok">Guaranteed</span><h3>Penguins &amp; guano birds</h3><p>Pelicans, boobies, Inca terns and Humboldt penguins at the Cavinzas Islands.</p></div></article>
      <article class="card card--top-gold"><div class="card__body"><span class="tag tag--seasonal">Seasonal</span><h3>Whales</h3><p>Sightings possible in some months · not guaranteed.</p></div></article>
