</section>

<!-- The islands -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="media">
      <figure class="media__figure">
        <img class="zoomable" src="/assets/img/hero-lobos-marinos.jpg" alt="Dozens of sea lions raise their heads out of the water beside the rocks of the Palomino Islands" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <div class="media__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Palomino Islands</p>
        <h2>A natural sanctuary in the sea off Callao</h2>
        <p>A group of islands behind San Lorenzo Island, home to 5,000–8,000 sea lions. Why it works so well:</p>
        <ul class="checklist" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">
          <li>Sea lions <strong>all year round</strong>.</li>
          <li>Just 30 minutes from Lima.</li>
          <li>The chance to swim with the sea lions in their habitat.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

